 Ishtar was forced to flee by an horde of Gangrel 4th gen, Saulot could not understand Xue teachings and the creation of the baali was one of the biggest &quot;oh I fucked pretty bad&quot; in the history of wod, Set was kept in check by Horus and Osiris, and in the end the Silent Striders managed to seal him under Egypt sands.<br /> There is an entire campaign in Transylvania Chronicles 4 where your players thwarted a maste plan of Absimiliard 700 years in the making.<br /> <br /> <br /> Keep in mind that Kemintiri was blessed by Horus himself, first among the Undiyng, so Set was dealing with powers on par with his.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 05-03-2018, 07:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T17:13:19-07:00","id":1214843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1214818-was-kemintiri-sire-really-set?p=1214830#post1214830\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Her character sheet, in the Red List book, she is a 4th gen Setite, and her sire is reported to be seth, and character sheet are out of characters.<br /> <br /> Besides that would be not the first time an antediluvian was fucked somehow, being immortal and invincible doesn't mean your plans will not go bum.<br /> Tzimisce was slain by Samiel in the second baali war, Troile could not win the Punic wars, Cappadocius could not make Lazarus come to the Feast of Folly, Ishtar was forced to flee by an horde of Gangrel 4th gen, Saulot could not understand Xue teachings and the creation of the baali was one of the biggest &quot;oh I fucked pretty bad&quot; in the history of wod, Set was kept in check by Horus and Osiris, and in the end the Silent Striders managed to seal him under Egypt sands.<br /> There is an entire campaign in Transylvania Chronicles 4 where your players thwarted a maste plan of Absimiliard 700 years in the making.<br /> <br /> <br /> Keep in mind that Kemintiri was blessed by Horus himself, first among the Undiyng, so Set was dealing with powers on par with his.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait,my knowledge of the Lore is failing,Salubri created the Baali by accident? Set was sealed by the silent striders?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T22:02:26-07:00","id":1214914,"title":"","content":"Her Sire was Set, but their Faith has a convoluted many layered mystery cult view on Set, and they likely revised their History. Sutekh is a God, his brother is a God. He is probably though a Godlike Vampire that wasn't always so beefy, and his brother didn't always used to be a god.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T22:30:22-07:00","id":1214918,"title":"","content":"Gods have been really buffed over the patch cycle back when Set was first out Godding he could do it with just 5 levels of disciplines..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T04:03:41-07:00","id":1214983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1214818-was-kemintiri-sire-really-set?p=1214843#post1214843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait,my knowledge of the Lore is failing,Salubri created the Baali by accident? Set was sealed by the silent striders?</div> </div> </div> </div>Black Dog's Clanbook:Baali pretty much state that it was Saulot who sired the first Baali. <br /> <br /> Tribebook Silent Strider (Rev.) goes into some details of the Osirian League's fight against Set. This led to Set's Curse on the Tribe that banished the from the land of Khem. So the second point is a bit of crosssplat info.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T04:20:29-07:00","id":1214987,"title":"","content":"Thanks for The answer guys. So it's correct to say that Kemintiri embrace does not proves set is not godly in some way? I ask because I became a big fan of the clan recently and I wouldn't like their whole religion to be false,alright it'd be fitting if some of it is of the mark","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T06:55:31-07:00","id":1215023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1214818-was-kemintiri-sire-really-set?p=1214987#post1214987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for The answer guys. So it's correct to say that Kemintiri embrace does not proves set is not godly in some way? I ask because I became a big fan of the clan recently and I wouldn't like their whole religion to be false,alright it'd be fitting if some of it is of the mark</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Would someone dying in a mere three hours of hanging on a cross disprove their divinity? according to quite a large number of people on this planet the answer would be: No.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T06:56:53-07:00","id":1215024,"title":"","content":"It depends on your definition of proof.<br /> <br /> Setite religion contradicts pretty much every Vampire book. Theres basically no reason to think it's true other than: Setites say so (and spirits exist)<br /> <br /> But then, biblical story contradicts real story a lot more (like, say, the world being 5000-6000 years old when humans existed for billons of years <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) and christians still believe it's true.<br /> <br /> In other words, proof?, what proof?. Obviously that 3rd gen Set isn't THE Set. It's just an imposter - lalala I'm not hearing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T07:21:06-07:00","id":1215031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Boneguard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1214818-was-kemintiri-sire-really-set?p=1214983#post1214983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Black Dog's Clanbook:Baali pretty much state that it was Saulot who sired the first Baali.</div> </div> </div> </div>They've walked that statement back since that book was published, though. There is conflicting information that suggests it could have been Cappadocius* or Tzimisce, at least, that led to the Baali. Or there are, as some here in this forum suggest, multiple times the Baali bloodline has sprung up, each with their own account for how it happened. I mean, Ur-Shulgi is still debated as Assamite or Baali. The writers did a lot to damage Saulot's reputation when trying to explain why the Tremere pogrom against the Salubri worked, because it shouldn't have, as others have noted on this forum.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> *As Ashur.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;At the risk of sounding like a murder hobo&quot;<br /> <br /> Attributed to Nyrufa.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame","name":"Inertial Frame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T16:00:41-07:00","id":1215254,"title":"","content":"In other words, we're right back at:<br /> <br /> &quot;It's whatever you want it to be in your game&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}